# "{T}: Add {R}. Activate only if you control a Mountain or a Plains" (CR 602.5b): with the Verge its only land, Bot1
# has no red mana, so Stadium Headliner's {R} is not offered to cast - the castability judgement asks the ability's
# condition as activating it does (a bot that was offered it cast, failed to pay and retried for the whole step). With
# a Plains beside it the {R} is there and the Headliner is cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Sunbillow Verge
Stadium Headliner
Plains
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Sunbillow Verge.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Stadium Headliner.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Stadium Headliner.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Sunbillow Verge.Activate(Ability: {R})
Bot1.Hand.Stadium Headliner.Cast

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Stadium Headliner; Sunbillow Verge
Bot1.Hand = Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
